@startuml
title GitForge V1.0.0 - Authorization Model
left to right direction
rectangle "Caller Context" {
    rectangle "Anonymous" as Anonymous
    rectangle "Authenticated User" as User
}
rectangle "Repository Context" {
    rectangle "Repository Owner" as Owner
    rectangle "Repository Visibility" as Visibility
}
rectangle "Requested Operation" as Operation
rectangle "Repository Authorization" as Authz
rectangle "Allow / Deny" as Decision
Anonymous --> Authz
User --> Authz
Owner --> Authz
Visibility --> Authz
Operation --> Authz
Authz --> Decision
note right of Authz
Read:
Public -> Allow all supported callers
Private -> Owner only
Write:
Owner only
Manage:
Owner only
end note
@enduml
